\newlabel{tab:sft_inflation}{{1}{2}{Score inflation (accuracy \%) by model scale, benchmark, and contamination dosage. Inflation is monotonic (Spearman $\rho = 0.90$ on MMLU) but inversely related to model scale: Qwen-0.5B shows 11.5~pp inflation at 100\% dosage vs.\ 5.2~pp for Qwen-3B}{table.1}{}}
